  },
  {
    "id": "hist_live_aid", "trigger": "history", "title": "Live Aid",
    "text": "A concert in two cities at once, sixteen hours long, on television everywhere, for the famine in Ethiopia. A man on screen keeps telling everyone to give money now.",
